  "description": "FUFWEL crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C50 H70 La4 O21. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.776-4.032 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.09-113.73°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula La4O(acac)10 (C50H70La4O21).",
